	(text "U401 EN = DISP_SW_A_EN (internal pull-down, off in MCU reset). 1.8 V (IOVCC, TP_IOVCC) comes up first,\nthen drives switch A ON (VIH 1.0 V): VCI_SW (3.1 V: VCC + CTP_VDD) follows ~3 ms later. ICNA3306 wants\nVDDI before VCI; the chain guarantees it with one GPIO. VCI must stay on V3: IC abs max 3.6 V." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 19 27 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8819c264-03b3-4f50-b390-68f57e46b15f"))
	(text "Switch B ON = VCI_SW: PMIC input exists only while the panel is powered, i.e. after firmware has run\n(and set BQ25188 SYS_REG below 4.5 V at boot). Frees the old DISP_SW_B_EN GPIO for PMIC CTRL." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 19 118 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d7d13f9a-70ac-4dd8-ad1c-4b484630882e"))
	(rectangle (start 210 20) (end 405 130) (stroke (width 0.254) (type dash) (color 72 72 72 1)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "9e29a313-fe87-457c-971d-e45632ab2254"))
	(text "B · ELVDD / ELVSS: TPS65631DPDR (TI Figure 10 values)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 211.5 21.5 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2673e5c7-0f6b-401b-9072-db9a96586ff2"))
