	)
	(text "CTRL = DISP_PMIC_CTRL (P0.23; internal 150-860k pull-down). The tail has no SWIRE, so the nRF enables\nthe PMIC and sends 21 rising edges (2-25 us each) -> VNEG -2.4 V. VNEG first ramps to -4.0 V default.\nFBS senses ELVDD: route it from the connector pins. Caps 10 V X5R; keep L/C within 2 mm of U404." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 214 27 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "362f26a6-b60a-4987-9795-4273d066e98b"))
	(text "R401 0R link: break ELVSS to measure the -4.0 V first ramp with no panel (OSPTEK must confirm the\npanel tolerates it; no ELVSS abs max published). L401/L402 DFE252010F-4R7M: 1.0 mm max,\nIsat 1.9 A, 240 mOhm max." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 214 118 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5b372c2d-062a-4a24-b7b9-fcb7c29f14cc"))
	(rectangle (start 15 140) (end 200 262) (stroke (width 0.254) (type dash) (color 72 72 72 1)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "73cacd64-fe2b-42b1-bb68-6fae26b36ec1"))
	(text "C · Level shifting: nRF 3.1 V  <->  panel/touch 1.8 V" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 16.5 141.5 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c52d0741-df91-49cc-a5ac-02915029a7dc"))
