	(text "Down (U405-U407, VCC = V1V8_DISP): 5.5 V-tolerant inputs + Ioff. With the panel off the buffers are\nunpowered and Hi-Z, so the NOR can use the shared SPIM with no back-power into the panel. SDO: not connected." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 19 147 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "907c8bc5-be08-444c-a592-3d5981b72071"))
	(text "Up (U408/U409 on V3): LVxT\ninputs, VIH 1.39 V max.\nU410: touch I2C -> main bus\n(CHSC6417 0x2E). OE = P_RST:\nisolated during touch reset,\nHi-Z when unpowered.\n10k pull-ups inside." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 160 204 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a2aba46c-5918-41ca-868d-5ee5f8d633a3"))
